    "enUS": {
      "description": "Having inserted a barrel of Marleth's Scalder in the Kharanos Distillery's cellar, you grab a barrel of Thunder Ale as proof of the deed...",
      "dialogue": {
        "ca994c03ad68c62db880": "Did you make the switch?",
        "fe72ab96a820bfb88724": "Not bad, $N!  Did you have a hard time getting past their guard?$B$BNo matter - many thanks, and if you're ever in need of stout with a kick, don't forget the Barleybrews!"
      },
      "summary": "Bring the barrel of Thunder Ale to Marleth Barleybrew at the Brewnall Village.",
      "title": "Return to Marleth",
